                "Phosgenator P-2 at Tolylene-Swale TS-6 still shows residual-phosgene IR at 420 ppm "
                "versus an 80 ppm stack cap. Jacket PT is a FRESH 2.40 bar, 2.40 under a 4.80 bar "
                "steam envelope; both tags carry LIVE and FRESH flags, neither is commissioning. "
                "IR-first must cut phosgene 8.4 t/h to 5.2. The weak supervisor inverts the lead-lag "
                "compensator and spends the cut on jacket steam 6.0 -> 2.1 t/h, leaving 8.4 t/h "
                "phosgene cruising.",